      "object_id": "mathia_interpretation_1faa6192be96f73de957614fe70646ede0571dada14d96671aa41c76cd0de5a5",
      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "Ideals are the representation repair that recovers multiplicativity when element factorization fails. The residue is not merely a singularity: it is an information-compressing boundary value containing global arithmetic geometry.",
