      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_e98fc47b816d1e2576c2d805fd78cbbff1bd2c40bb478bd17b59011a34a78ec3",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The source separates two burdens: local Euler factors contribute vertical periodic divisor lattices at rationally independent prime frequencies, while completion turns zeta into an entire divisor with reflection and conjugation symmetry; the DL-minimality proposal then conjecturally selects the symmetry-fixed critical line.",
